This is my girlfriend, Han Gyu Rim.

32
00:03:15,028 --> 00:03:16,128
Thank you.

33
00:03:18,058 --> 00:03:20,598
So, what should we do first? Give us some work.

34
00:03:27,508 --> 00:03:28,508
Great.

35
