40
00:03:41,658 --> 00:03:42,888
Let us not make any mistakes.

41
00:03:43,488 --> 00:03:44,788
As long as you do not make any.

42
00:03:45,758 --> 00:03:47,458
I never make mistakes.

43
00:03:49,098 --> 00:03:52,468
This is an emergency, so stay alert, got it?

44
00:03:52,868 --> 00:03:53,868
Okay.

45
00:03:54,128 --> 00:03:55,138
Okay.

46
00:03:55,868 --> 00:03:57,898
- Good luck. - Good luck.

47
