66
00:05:50,748 --> 00:05:52,188
I will reorder it with the kitchen.

67
00:05:52,718 --> 00:05:54,788
I am sorry.

68
00:05:55,158 --> 00:05:56,158
I am sorry.

69
00:05:59,758 --> 00:06:00,758
It is okay.

70
00:06:05,728 --> 00:06:07,628
I am sorry. I am so sorry.

71
00:06:07,698 --> 00:06:08,798
Due to my mistake, the food you ordered...

72
00:06:08,868 --> 00:06:10,068
