73
00:06:11,298 --> 00:06:12,438
I am really sorry.

74
00:06:13,138 --> 00:06:15,178
I am sorry.

75
00:07:00,218 --> 00:07:03,218
(Good Strategy, Bad Strategy)

76
00:07:31,048 --> 00:07:33,048
She said she was a deity.

77
00:07:34,248 --> 00:07:37,288
Even Shaman Park said in her 38 years of practice,

78
00:07:37,488 --> 00:07:40,158
