89
00:08:13,258 --> 00:08:14,728
Mister, do you have any leftover soju?

90
00:08:14,888 --> 00:08:16,498
You do not keep whiskey or anything at home, do you?

91
00:08:18,498 --> 00:08:19,928
What did you just say?

92
00:08:20,628 --> 00:08:23,638
The way she is talking right now, she is acting like a sly fox.

93
00:08:23,998 --> 00:08:26,638
It seems she has come to her senses.

94
00:08:26,708 --> 00:08:28,108
No.

95
00:08:28,438 --> 00:08:30,178
The doctor said...

96
00:08:30,238 --> 00:08:31,238
