97
00:08:32,348 --> 00:08:34,708
Do you recognise him?

98
00:08:35,108 --> 00:08:36,778
The one you crushed when you were in your right mind,

99
00:08:36,848 --> 00:08:38,248
the one you treated like dog crap,

100
00:08:38,318 --> 00:08:40,488
you know this is Jo Heung Sik, right?

101
00:08:43,418 --> 00:08:44,958
Why are you calling him that?

102
00:08:45,058 --> 00:08:46,758
He is my younger brother, Nam Jeong Bae.

103
00:08:47,088 --> 00:08:48,658
Jeong Bae, you eat this.

104
00:08:52,428 --> 00:08:53,698
I do not think she is in her right mind, Mom.

105
00:08:53,768 --> 00:08:55,268
What should we do?

106
00:08:56,538 --> 00:08:58,468
And who is Nam Jeong Bae?

107
00:09:00,868 --> 00:09:02,278
I think she is drifting in and out.

108
00:09:02,338 --> 00:09:03,408
You rotten punk.

109
00:09:03,678 --> 00:09:05,878
Instead of chicken feet, I just want to rip off...

110
00:09:06,178 --> 00:09:08,378
these darn hands and throw them to her to eat.

111
00:09:09,218 --> 00:09:11,618
Why are you doing this, Mom? Are we filming a horror movie?

112
00:09:18,018 --> 00:09:19,788
She is worse than a nine-tailed fox.

113
00:09:20,258 --> 00:09:21,898
All of this at once...

114
00:09:25,528 --> 00:09:26,898
- Goodbye. - Goodbye. Thank you.

115
00:09:26,968 --> 00:09:27,968
- Thank you. - Thank you.

116
00:09:29,798 --> 00:09:31,298
Thank you, get home safely.

117
00:09:38,438 --> 00:09:39,578
Are you gangsters?

118
00:09:40,148 --> 00:09:41,708
I am sorry for making a mistake earlier.

119
00:09:42,648 --> 00:09:43,978
I am sorry.

120
00:09:54,558 --> 00:09:57,698
I was so scared I thought I was going to go crazy.

121
00:09:59,368 --> 00:10:00,628
If it were not for you guys,

122
00:10:01,398 --> 00:10:03,768
I might have actually died from a heart attack.

123
00:10:06,138 --> 00:10:07,908
Thank you so much.

124
00:10:13,508 --> 00:10:15,878
If we are like this, how is the kitchen right now?

125
00:10:35,228 --> 00:10:38,138
Thank you, Chef Ho Yoon. With this, I have paid back...

126
00:10:38,198 --> 00:10:39,538
one-tenth of what I owe you, right?

127
00:10:41,068 --> 00:10:42,308
Hey, eat before you go.

128
00:11:09,868 --> 00:11:10,868
Thank you.

129
00:11:12,338 --> 00:11:13,608
Great job today.

130
00:11:14,708 --> 00:11:15,978
You too, Mu Jin.

131
00:11:16,838 --> 00:11:18,848
You really did a great job today.

132
00:11:27,548 --> 00:11:31,618
Back off a little. I cannot breathe. I said back off.

133
00:11:32,658 --> 00:11:34,688
Han Gyu Seo, what are you doing right now?

134
00:11:35,128 --> 00:11:38,558
Let go of me. People are looking at us weirdly.

135
00:11:39,168 --> 00:11:40,728
Who is looking at us weirdly?

136
00:11:40,798 --> 00:11:42,668
Is it your first time seeing a younger brother hug his brother?

137
00:11:43,238 --> 00:11:46,468
Yes, it is my first time. I have seen it a lot in movies,

138
00:11:46,538 --> 00:11:48,108
but it is my first time seeing it in real life.

139
00:11:48,168 --> 00:11:51,138
What is wrong with him today? Did I do something to him today?

140
00:11:52,278 --> 00:11:53,678
I am so glad I have you.

141
00:11:54,278 --> 00:11:56,678
Having you in my life is such a huge relief.

142
00:11:59,488 --> 00:12:03,058
The plate disaster today? Right.

143
00:12:03,118 --> 00:12:04,218
If it were not for you, Gyu Oh,

144
00:12:04,288 --> 00:12:05,488
