145
00:12:05,858 --> 00:12:09,328
Still, this is too much. Hey, even with my girlfriend,

146
00:12:09,398 --> 00:12:11,128
I do not hug her like this, man.

147
00:12:11,728 --> 00:12:15,938
Just let him hug you, Gyu Oh. Han Gyu Seo kept saying he wanted to...

148
00:12:15,998 --> 00:12:17,938
give you a big hug anyway.

149
00:12:18,198 --> 00:12:20,238
Why would he hug me? And a big one at that.

150
00:12:21,638 --> 00:12:22,878
Because you've finally come to your senses...

151
00:12:22,938 --> 00:12:26,678
and are living a proper life. You quit being a host bar worker...

152
00:12:28,478 --> 00:12:29,648
And...

153
00:12:39,128 --> 00:12:41,458
You guys only know half the story, do you not?

154
00:12:48,838 --> 00:12:49,838
Ta-da.

155
00:12:51,098 --> 00:12:52,868
- What is this? - What is it?

156
00:12:54,438 --> 00:12:56,008
Half the shares of this store are mine,

157
00:12:56,078 --> 00:12:57,578
and it opens next Sunday.

158
00:12:57,878 --> 00:13:00,008
- I am a boss now. - Are these not clothes?

159
00:13:00,078 --> 00:13:01,078
It looks like a clothing store.

160
00:13:01,148 --> 00:13:03,978
A boss this handsome, cool, and young,

161
00:13:04,248 --> 00:13:06,518
in your 18 years of life, you've probably never seen one.

162
00:13:07,788 --> 00:13:10,118
From now on, your older brother...

163
00:13:10,488 --> 00:13:12,388
is going to become so amazing and cool,

164
00:13:12,888 --> 00:13:14,258
so you can look forward to it, twins.

165
00:13:17,698 --> 00:13:19,668
Thank you, Gyu Oh.

166
00:13:20,428 --> 00:13:22,738
Thank you, Gyu Oh.

167
00:13:24,138 --> 00:13:25,138
Han Gyu Oh,

168
00:13:25,738 --> 00:13:28,008
making your younger siblings worry about you,

169
00:13:28,908 --> 00:13:30,508
what kind of life have you been living?

170
00:13:32,278 --> 00:13:33,278
It is okay, Gyu Oh.

171
00:13:34,448 --> 00:13:35,718
It is all in the past.

172
00:13:36,648 --> 00:13:38,048
As long as Gyu Rim does not know, it is fine.

173
00:13:39,588 --> 00:13:40,688
That is right, Gyu Oh.

174
00:13:41,548 --> 00:13:43,158
As long as Gyu Rim does not find out, it is fine.

175
00:13:46,588 --> 00:13:47,858
Yes.

176
00:13:49,328 --> 00:13:50,798
As long as she does not find out, it is fine.

177
00:13:53,098 --> 00:13:54,468
Congratulations, Gyu Oh.

178
00:13:54,528 --> 00:13:57,968
You made a really good decision. Congratulations.

179
00:14:09,548 --> 00:14:12,418
I figured out your true identity today.

180
00:14:14,848 --> 00:14:15,858
You...

181
00:14:17,558 --> 00:14:18,888
You are my guardian angel.

182
00:14:23,558 --> 00:14:26,528
You must be tired. Hurry up and go inside.

183
00:14:26,798 --> 00:14:28,598
When you get in, do not even wash up,

184
00:14:28,668 --> 00:14:31,868
just crash and go straight to sleep. Got it?

185
00:14:32,868 --> 00:14:35,308
Even if Gyeol asks you to do something,

186
00:14:35,438 --> 00:14:36,778
just tell him you will do it tomorrow,

187
00:14:36,878 --> 00:14:37,978
and get some good sleep.

188
00:14:38,708 --> 00:14:40,708
I understand. Hurry up and go.

189
00:14:44,878 --> 00:14:45,888
I should just go?

190
00:14:46,918 --> 00:14:48,048
Well...

191
00:14:48,858 --> 00:14:50,218
Are you not going to say goodbye?

192
00:14:51,088 --> 00:14:54,728
- I did, just a moment ago. - Not like that.

193
00:14:57,898 --> 00:15:00,268
Are you not going to give me a passionate hug or something?

194
00:15:09,108 --> 00:15:11,078
Next time, you should do it first. Okay?

195
00:15:11,338 --> 00:15:13,708
My shy guardian angel.

196
00:15:17,918 --> 00:15:19,118
Go and get some rest.

197
00:15:19,648 --> 00:15:20,648
I will go.

198
00:15:22,088 --> 00:15:23,088
Goodbye.

199
00:15:24,758 --> 00:15:25,828
Bye.

200
00:15:26,288 --> 00:15:27,628
Thank you for today.

201
00:15:32,528 --> 00:15:33,528
Should I stay a little longer?

202
00:16:08,098 --> 00:16:10,068
I heard from the Buddhist follower earlier...

203
00:16:10,498 --> 00:16:12,508
that young lady has been here since four in the morning...

204
00:16:12,868 --> 00:16:15,068
doing 3,000 bows.

205
00:16:15,808 --> 00:16:18,038
Wow. What in the world is she praying for...

206
00:16:18,108 --> 00:16:19,708
to do something so intense?

207
00:16:21,378 --> 00:16:22,448
Mom,

208
00:16:22,818 --> 00:16:24,848
could you do 3,000 bows for me?

209
00:16:25,378 --> 00:16:26,588
Oh, please...

210
00:16:26,748 --> 00:16:28,418
You should be the one doing 3,000 bows...

211
00:16:28,488 --> 00:16:31,188
- for your mother first, you brat. - Gosh...

212
00:16:45,598 --> 00:16:48,108
(Wishing For Han Gyu Oh's Business Prosperity And Happiness)

213
00:17:03,918 --> 00:17:05,728
(Han Gyu Oh)

214
00:17:06,488 --> 00:17:07,528
Han Gyu Oh?

215
00:17:10,728 --> 00:17:12,468
How do you know Han Gyu Oh?

216
00:17:14,868 --> 00:17:17,898
I was just wondering if it is the Han Gyu Oh I know.

217
00:17:18,038 --> 00:17:23,338
Is he in his late twenties, without double eyelids, and handsome?

218
00:17:24,878 --> 00:17:25,878
Who are you?

219
00:17:26,778 --> 00:17:30,578
Who I am is not important. How do you know Han Gyu Oh?

220
00:17:31,818 --> 00:17:33,148
He is my younger brother.

221
00:17:33,648 --> 00:17:35,088
What do you mean, your younger brother?

222
00:17:35,588 --> 00:17:37,218
A younger brother is a younger brother.

223
00:17:37,288 --> 00:17:38,818
What other kind of younger brother is there?

224
00:17:40,128 --> 00:17:42,658
How do you know our Gyu Oh, ma'am?

225
00:17:43,658 --> 00:17:46,398
I told you, who I am is not important.

226
00:17:46,868 --> 00:17:48,368
Where is Han Gyu Oh right now?

227
00:17:50,198 --> 00:17:52,508
I do not know which Han Gyu Oh you are looking for,

228
00:17:52,568 --> 00:17:54,668
but I do not think our Gyu Oh is someone...

229
00:17:54,738 --> 00:17:56,408
a lady like you would be looking for.

230
00:17:59,148 --> 00:18:00,648
A lady like me?

231
00:18:01,408 --> 00:18:05,478
Do you know who I am? Do you have any idea...

232
00:18:05,578 --> 00:18:08,948
- how incredible of a person I am? - Mom, stop it. We are at a temple.

233
00:18:15,288 --> 00:18:16,298
What is her deal?

234
00:18:16,998 --> 00:18:19,598
She is insulting me right now, is she not?

235
00:18:21,328 --> 00:18:22,868
No, just stop it, Mom.

236
00:18:23,168 --> 00:18:24,498
Do you want to get scolded by Buddha?

237
00:18:25,138 --> 00:18:27,238
Seriously.

238
00:18:28,268 --> 00:18:29,738
Merciful Buddha.

239
00:18:35,178 --> 00:18:36,178
But Mom...

240
00:18:37,248 --> 00:18:38,518
How do you know Han Gyu Oh?

241
00:18:40,418 --> 00:18:42,888
He is just a younger cousin.

242
00:18:45,088 --> 00:18:47,258
I do not have an uncle named Han Gyu Oh.

243
00:18:48,358 --> 00:18:50,428
Do you know all of my distant cousins?

244
00:18:51,028 --> 00:18:53,498
Why are you being so nosy, you brat?

245
00:18:58,638 --> 00:19:01,468
Suspicious. Something is very...

246
00:19:02,638 --> 00:19:03,978
unpleasantly suspicious.

247
00:19:08,048 --> 00:19:10,918
- Mom, let us talk for a second. - Enough. Why do you keep asking?

248
00:19:10,978 --> 00:19:12,748
I am asking how you know Han Gyu Oh.

249
00:19:12,848 --> 00:19:14,748
- Why do I have a bad feeling? - I told you to stop.

250
00:19:15,118 --> 00:19:16,458
I have to go shopping now. Stop it.

251
00:19:16,588 --> 00:19:17,718
Wait a minute.

252
00:19:26,828 --> 00:19:28,128
What should I say when I meet Gyeol?

253
00:19:30,198 --> 00:19:32,068
That I am his uncle's girlfriend?

254
00:19:34,408 --> 00:19:36,308
He is going to be completely shocked.

255
00:19:38,738 --> 00:19:41,908
He even confessed to me at the beginning of the semester...

256
00:19:42,108 --> 00:19:43,318
that he wanted to marry someone like me.

257
00:19:45,778 --> 00:19:47,248
I should buy him something delicious to eat...

258
00:19:47,318 --> 00:19:49,518
and explain things to him one by one so he understands,

259
00:19:50,158 --> 00:19:51,858
to minimize the shock.

260
00:19:53,728 --> 00:19:54,888
What should I do?

261
00:19:54,958 --> 00:19:56,898
I have to greet my future in-laws, too.

262
00:19:58,358 --> 00:19:59,428
No.

263
00:20:00,198 --> 00:20:01,598
The opening ceremony is not the right time.

264
00:20:09,908 --> 00:20:12,038
Is Han Gyu Oh a gigolo by any chance?

265
00:20:13,948 --> 00:20:15,948
How would my mom know Han Gyu Oh?

266
00:20:16,448 --> 00:20:18,818
If he is a handsome man in his late twenties with monolids,

267
00:20:19,488 --> 00:20:20,488
that is Han Gyu Oh, right?

268
00:20:25,558 --> 00:20:26,688
Why are you asking me that?

269
00:20:27,258 --> 00:20:28,728
Ask your mom yourself.

270
00:20:35,028 --> 00:20:36,798
I am sure Han Gyu Oh is a gigolo.

271
00:20:37,238 --> 00:20:38,498
I would bet my hand that Han Gyu Oh is a gigolo.

272
00:20:38,568 --> 00:20:39,568
I would bet my own hand.

273
00:20:50,118 --> 00:20:52,718
But are you okay with having a gigolo boyfriend?

274
00:20:53,688 --> 00:20:55,188
You are even a school teacher.

275
00:20:59,228 --> 00:21:00,658
Han Gyu Oh is not a gigolo.

276
00:21:01,028 --> 00:21:03,158
He is a hardworking man who does his job diligently,

277
00:21:03,728 --> 00:21:05,898
and he is definitely not the person your mom knows.

278
00:21:06,668 --> 00:21:08,998
If you send me this kind of message one more time...

279
00:21:09,068 --> 00:21:11,768
and slander my Gyu Oh, I will go find your mom.

280
00:21:13,368 --> 00:21:16,708
How you tried to buy my Gyu Oh by throwing your mom's money around,

281
00:21:16,878 --> 00:21:17,978
I will expose it all.

282
00:21:30,358 --> 00:21:32,688
Why? Do you want me to fold a paper tile with this?

283
00:21:33,228 --> 00:21:34,228
No.

284
00:21:34,458 --> 00:21:36,858
Uncle Gyu Oh is opening his clothing store today.

285
00:21:37,298 --> 00:21:38,928
They say my oldest uncle is the boss!

286
00:21:39,498 --> 00:21:40,498
What?

287
00:21:41,598 --> 00:21:43,438
Gyu Oh finally agreed to it.

288
00:21:45,538 --> 00:21:46,868
Hooray.

289
00:21:47,208 --> 00:21:50,178
My son is a clothing store owner. Hooray.

290
00:21:50,238 --> 00:21:52,748
My mom is a side dish store owner, too.

291
00:21:52,808 --> 00:21:56,178
That is right, my daughter is a side dish store owner, too.

292
00:21:56,178 --> 00:21:57,178
Hooray.

293
00:21:58,548 --> 00:22:01,618
Wow, our family is just overflowing with business owners.

294
00:22:02,488 --> 00:22:03,788
- Grandpa. - Yes?

295
00:22:03,958 --> 00:22:05,488
I am the class vice president, too.

296
00:22:05,618 --> 00:22:08,558
That is right, hooray for our vice president Han Gyeol, too.

297
00:22:09,258 --> 00:22:13,328
Man, should I ask them to make me the neighbourhood head or something?

298
00:22:15,798 --> 00:22:17,498
- But Grandpa. - Yes.

299
00:22:18,438 --> 00:22:20,738
I have been watching you for ten days,

300
00:22:21,168 --> 00:22:24,738
and you agreed to share this mat with my mom,

301
00:22:25,008 --> 00:22:26,778
so why are you using it all by yourself?

302
00:22:27,548 --> 00:22:29,518
My mom groans in her sleep, too,

303
00:22:29,578 --> 00:22:33,518
- and her whole body aches. - Goodness, a man without a son...

304
00:22:33,588 --> 00:22:34,588
cannot even live in peace...

305
00:22:35,248 --> 00:22:37,318
No, I do have sons.

306
00:22:37,858 --> 00:22:38,918
I have two of them.

307
00:22:40,528 --> 00:22:44,498
Hold on a second. Where is our CEO right now?

308
00:22:47,668 --> 00:22:49,028
Gyu Seo and I will head out a bit early...

309
00:22:49,098 --> 00:22:50,098
and hand out flyers.

310
00:22:51,838 --> 00:22:53,138
High schoolers should be studying.

311
00:22:53,338 --> 00:22:54,838
- We're not into studying. - We're not into studying.

312
00:22:56,508 --> 00:22:57,578
- We have too many other things... - We have too many other things...

313
00:22:57,578 --> 00:22:58,578
- on our minds besides studying. - on our minds besides studying.

314
00:23:02,478 --> 00:23:04,218
You two really must be soul twins.

315
00:23:05,918 --> 00:23:07,918
Anyway, it is your opening day.

316
00:23:07,988 --> 00:23:09,488
Should you not at least go to a salon?

317
00:23:10,188 --> 00:23:11,688
If I get any more handsome,

318
00:23:11,788 --> 00:23:12,958
I will have to debut in entertainment.

319
00:23:15,888 --> 00:23:18,298
Our CEO!

320
00:23:19,698 --> 00:23:21,498
Hey, but this shirt,

321
00:23:21,568 --> 00:23:25,198
it is a brand that is super popular among my friends.

322
00:23:26,668 --> 00:23:29,938
This is your staff uniform, right?

323
00:23:30,508 --> 00:23:32,008
Give me one too.

324
00:23:32,078 --> 00:23:34,578
I will do an amazing job promoting it for you.

325
00:23:35,108 --> 00:23:37,578
It is pretty.

326
00:23:38,648 --> 00:23:40,748
Gyu Oh...

327
00:23:41,918 --> 00:23:43,118
Gyu Oh.

328
00:23:43,858 --> 00:23:46,458
Gyu Oh, well, this...

329
00:23:46,758 --> 00:23:50,498
Let your father be of some help to you...

330
00:23:50,558 --> 00:23:52,228
since our eldest son is starting a new life.

331
00:23:52,298 --> 00:23:53,298
Let go.

332
00:23:54,068 --> 00:23:55,068
No.

333
00:23:56,138 --> 00:23:59,138
- Father. - No. I cannot let go.

334
00:23:59,508 --> 00:24:01,438
Until you give your father something to do,

335
00:24:01,538 --> 00:24:02,538
I am not letting go.

336
00:24:03,738 --> 00:24:07,578
You and I just do not remember,

337
00:24:07,848 --> 00:24:11,278
but I might be a better father than you think...

338
00:24:11,878 --> 00:24:14,418
No, I might be a decent father.

339
00:24:14,818 --> 00:24:16,818
Just ask Gyu Min and Gyu Seo.

340
00:24:17,288 --> 00:24:21,188
What is it? No. Not just decent,

341
00:24:21,458 --> 00:24:24,428
I might actually be a much more wonderful father.

342
00:24:24,858 --> 00:24:27,868
I might be a touching and respectable father...

343
00:24:28,328 --> 00:24:30,998
who brings you to tears when you think about it.

344
00:24:31,138 --> 00:24:33,868
- I get it. Let go. - Wait, wait.

345
00:24:34,568 --> 00:24:35,608
I said let go.

346
00:24:36,068 --> 00:24:38,838
Gyu Rim, think about it a bit more.

347
00:24:38,908 --> 00:24:41,308
Something your father did well. No, no.

348
00:24:41,378 --> 00:24:43,478
Something I did really well for Gyu Oh.

349
00:24:43,578 --> 00:24:47,248
- Hurry up and think of something. - My arm hurts. Let go.

350
00:24:47,388 --> 00:24:48,488
- No. - Let go.

351
00:24:48,648 --> 00:24:50,158
- No. - Let go and talk.

352
00:24:50,358 --> 00:24:51,758
- No. - Let me go.

353
00:24:51,918 --> 00:24:53,258
- No. - Let go.

354
00:24:53,328 --> 00:24:54,388
No, no.

355
00:24:54,758 --> 00:24:57,598
The final interviewees will come to the restaurant later.

356
00:24:57,998 --> 00:24:59,928
For the customers whose reservations we cancelled...

357
00:24:59,998 --> 00:25:01,798
over the past ten days,

358
00:25:01,868 --> 00:25:03,038
we agreed to give them a ten percent discount...

359
00:25:03,098 --> 00:25:04,198
on their next visit.

360
00:25:04,568 --> 00:25:07,868
- Make it 30 percent. - Does money grow on trees?

361
00:25:08,168 --> 00:25:11,408
We have already suffered huge losses from not being able to do business.

362
00:25:11,508 --> 00:25:14,648
I said 30 percent. What good is 10 percent?

363
00:25:17,348 --> 00:25:19,818
Even if you have to deduct it from my salary, make it 30 percent.

364
00:25:21,348 --> 00:25:22,688
Not sending you to the National Assembly...

365
00:25:22,748 --> 00:25:24,058
is my greatest regret.

366
00:25:31,398 --> 00:25:32,398
What...

367
00:25:32,798 --> 00:25:33,798
What is this?

368
00:25:36,128 --> 00:25:37,768
Why? What is it?

369
00:25:38,238 --> 00:25:40,738
It is a video online, but the thumbnail...

370
00:25:41,638 --> 00:25:42,808
What is this?

371
00:25:44,078 --> 00:25:47,308
"Exposing Chef Kim Mu Jin of Restaurant Dasolo"?

372
00:25:47,908 --> 00:25:48,908
What?

373
00:25:52,678 --> 00:25:55,518
Chef Kim Mu Jin might not be on TV.

374
00:25:55,588 --> 00:25:57,158
But is he not well-known in the industry?

375
00:25:58,358 --> 00:25:59,358
That is right.

376
00:25:59,928 --> 00:26:01,688
People say he is about to get a Michelin star,

377
00:26:02,328 --> 00:26:03,828
which made my conscience weigh even heavier.

378
00:26:04,158 --> 00:26:06,398
I felt I had to confess the truth before it was too late,

379
00:26:06,468 --> 00:26:07,728
which is why I decided to come forward.

380
00:26:08,028 --> 00:26:12,398
If what you are reporting is true, this is quite shocking.

381
00:26:12,638 --> 00:26:15,038
You are saying that in the kitchen of a hotel-grade restaurant,

382
00:26:15,438 --> 00:26:16,808
they were recycling food.

383
00:26:17,738 --> 00:26:18,738
Yes.

384
00:26:19,178 --> 00:26:21,478
I saw them take the leftovers from customers...

385
00:26:21,548 --> 00:26:22,548
and prepare them again...

386
00:26:22,608 --> 00:26:24,818
to use in other dishes on multiple occasions.

387
00:26:25,418 --> 00:26:27,118
The customers cannot tell the difference...

388
00:26:27,248 --> 00:26:29,518
- once the sauce is changed. - And the origin of the ingredients.

389
00:26:30,718 --> 00:26:32,988
This is Yong Cheol, right?

390
00:26:33,288 --> 00:26:35,488
They can blur his face and alter his voice all they want,

391
00:26:35,688 --> 00:26:38,528
but that is definitely Yong Cheol. Is this guy out of his mind?

392
00:26:40,098 --> 00:26:41,928
What does he mean, we recycle food?

393
00:26:41,998 --> 00:26:43,298
Do they not know who Kim Mu Jin is?

394
00:26:45,668 --> 00:26:47,768
You said they also falsified the origin of the ingredients.

395
00:26:47,968 --> 00:26:49,268
Passing off Chilean products as domestic...

396
00:26:49,678 --> 00:26:50,978
and Chinese products as Italian.

397
00:26:51,438 --> 00:26:54,278
How can such a famous and expensive restaurant...

398
00:26:54,448 --> 00:26:56,918
play around with the food that they serve to people?

399
00:26:58,918 --> 00:27:01,048
I was also deeply tormented and struggled with it.

400
00:27:01,888 --> 00:27:05,318
But since I had no power on my own, I was in no position to protest.

401
00:27:06,018 --> 00:27:07,188
So the employees gathered together...

402
00:27:07,258 --> 00:27:08,858
and discussed whether we should expose this...

403
00:27:09,288 --> 00:27:10,698
because if we kept turning a blind eye,

404
00:27:10,758 --> 00:27:13,068
- we would become accomplices too. - Turn it off.

405
00:27:13,128 --> 00:27:14,368
We also worried about what would happen...

406
00:27:14,428 --> 00:27:15,428
I need to see what kind of lies...

407
00:27:15,498 --> 00:27:17,498
- If a customer actually got sick... - he keeps spouting.

408
00:27:18,038 --> 00:27:19,398
Those were the things we talked about.

409
00:27:30,378 --> 00:27:33,188
How should I kill this crazy lunatic?

410
00:27:35,418 --> 00:27:36,618
Now that I think about it,

411
00:27:36,818 --> 00:27:38,188
Yong Cheol must have taken all the guys with him.

412
00:27:38,258 --> 00:27:39,788
Everyone except your guy, Gyu Min.

413
00:27:42,028 --> 00:27:43,028
What is it?

414
00:27:43,528 --> 00:27:45,498
Why on earth is he doing this to you?

415
00:27:46,368 --> 00:27:48,628
Did you hit Yong Cheol behind my back?

416
00:27:51,838 --> 00:27:53,638
Did his girlfriend fall for you?

417
00:27:53,708 --> 00:27:56,478
Did you kill his parents or something?

418
00:27:57,178 --> 00:27:59,708
Did our competitor buy him off? Does he gamble?

419
00:28:00,378 --> 00:28:02,648
Seriously, what could have made him turn on us like this?

420
00:28:03,248 --> 00:28:04,278
What could it be?

421
00:28:05,548 --> 00:28:06,548
Who is behind this?

422
00:28:08,888 --> 00:28:09,888
What is going on?

423
00:28:12,658 --> 00:28:15,488
Seo Yong Cheol's mother is currently hospitalised,

424
00:28:15,558 --> 00:28:16,958
and her medical bills up to this point...

425
00:28:17,058 --> 00:28:18,128
have all been paid in full.

426
00:28:18,698 --> 00:28:20,828
They also said future expenses will be paid...

427
00:28:20,968 --> 00:28:22,028
from the Chairman's personal account.

428
00:28:24,338 --> 00:28:25,538
I understand. You may leave.

429
00:28:36,848 --> 00:28:38,318
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

430
00:28:38,478 --> 00:28:39,748
Yes, Chairman Hong.

431
00:28:40,848 --> 00:28:42,648
Secretary Kim, do we have any liquor?

432
00:28:43,488 --> 00:28:44,688
A double shot of whiskey, neat.

433
00:28:44,758 --> 00:28:47,288
- Bring me a glass. - Yes, understood.

434
00:28:56,868 --> 00:28:59,468
Jeong Bae, Nam Jeong Bae. Give me some milk.

435
00:28:59,908 --> 00:29:01,308
She is not here.

436
00:29:02,438 --> 00:29:03,438
Do you have any beer?

437
00:29:03,938 --> 00:29:08,478
I think I am going to go crazy. Seriously.

438
00:29:08,608 --> 00:29:10,078
How did I end up like this?

439
00:29:10,378 --> 00:29:11,648
Did the great Han Gyu Young hide away...

440
00:29:11,718 --> 00:29:13,448
and stay cooped up in a room...

441
00:29:13,548 --> 00:29:14,788
after studying so hard to become a doctor...

442
00:29:14,848 --> 00:29:17,658
- and even studying abroad? - Justice will prevail.

443
00:29:17,718 --> 00:29:19,118
What goes around comes around.

444
00:29:20,788 --> 00:29:22,158
Stop glaring at me.

445
00:29:22,228 --> 00:29:24,558
It only hurts your eyes. It does not hurt me at all.

446
00:29:25,328 --> 00:29:26,968
Darn it...

447
00:29:29,428 --> 00:29:31,898
Where are you going? Can you take me with you?

448
00:29:32,198 --> 00:29:33,938
I have been cooped up in this room so long,

449
00:29:34,008 --> 00:29:36,338
I feel like I am going to turn into a madwoman.

450
00:29:36,338 --> 00:29:38,308
Even if it is not a luxury boutique,

451
00:29:38,378 --> 00:29:40,378
can you not just take me out for some fresh air?

452
00:29:43,078 --> 00:29:44,578
All right, let us go together then.

453
00:29:45,348 --> 00:29:47,888
Today is the day of Gyu Oh's opening ceremony.

454
00:29:48,348 --> 00:29:49,348
What?

455
00:29:49,588 --> 00:29:51,018
What opening ceremony is Gyu Oh having?

456
00:29:52,018 --> 00:29:53,018
Look at this.

457
00:29:54,858 --> 00:29:56,328
Gyu Oh is a boss now.

458
00:29:56,858 --> 00:29:59,228
I heard his friend gave him half the shares.

459
00:29:59,658 --> 00:30:00,668
Wait.

460
00:30:01,028 --> 00:30:03,568
Why would his friend give him half the shares?

461
00:30:05,938 --> 00:30:07,268
Did Gyu Oh threaten him?

462
00:30:07,438 --> 00:30:10,608
- Did Gyu Oh beat him up for them? - Some sister you are.

463
00:30:10,938 --> 00:30:13,608
Do you not know how great of a person your brother is?

464
00:30:13,908 --> 00:30:15,778
In this day and age?

465
00:30:15,948 --> 00:30:17,518
People do not even give shares to their own family,

466
00:30:17,578 --> 00:30:18,978
so why would a friend give them away?

467
00:30:19,048 --> 00:30:22,418
I told you earlier, did I not? Justice will prevail.

468
00:30:22,988 --> 00:30:26,488
He owed Gyu Oh a favour, so he gave them to him to repay it.

469
00:30:26,588 --> 00:30:28,458
- Are you done? - Darn it.

470
00:30:29,228 --> 00:30:31,528
He treats me, his own sister, like garbage,

471
00:30:31,528 --> 00:30:33,328
but to a friend who does not share a single drop of blood with him,

472
00:30:33,398 --> 00:30:35,068
what kind of amazing thing did he do?

473
00:30:35,128 --> 00:30:37,498
Is that really something to be angry about right now?

474
00:30:37,668 --> 00:30:38,898
I am furious.

475
00:30:39,438 --> 00:30:41,268
Why do I feel so wronged and angry?

476
00:30:44,108 --> 00:30:46,748
- Is this it? - Boss, today in Paju,

477
00:30:46,808 --> 00:30:47,808
the photoshoot.

478
00:30:47,878 --> 00:30:49,948
- You did not forget, right? - I forgot.

479
00:30:51,448 --> 00:30:52,648
All right, I got it.

480
00:30:53,848 --> 00:30:54,848
I will head there right now.

481
00:30:55,418 --> 00:30:56,418
Okay.

482
00:31:02,388 --> 00:31:03,398
Grandma.

483
00:31:05,598 --> 00:31:06,768
Right...

484
00:31:07,128 --> 00:31:09,028
You are my karma, are you not?

485
00:31:09,268 --> 00:31:12,398
Committed knowingly or unknowingly in this life and past lives,

486
00:31:12,498 --> 00:31:13,968
you are my karma.

487
00:31:14,408 --> 00:31:16,778
Are you going to Gyu Oh's opening party too, Mother?

488
00:31:16,908 --> 00:31:18,638
I do not think I can go because I have plans.

489
00:31:18,708 --> 00:31:20,548
How could I go there?

490
00:31:20,678 --> 00:31:23,108
Their whole family will be gathered there.

491
00:31:23,618 --> 00:31:26,548
I feel like a sinner. How could I even face them?

492
00:31:26,648 --> 00:31:27,848
My conscience is so guilty,

493
00:31:28,118 --> 00:31:30,918
- how could I even stand there? - Yes, please do not go.

494
00:31:32,188 --> 00:31:35,188
Since this crazy girl is telling me not to go,

495
00:31:35,488 --> 00:31:37,728
it makes me wonder if I should go.

496
00:31:39,868 --> 00:31:41,598
Please, do not say anything.

497
00:31:41,668 --> 00:31:43,768
- You have to zip it. - I will kick you.

498
00:31:43,838 --> 00:31:45,638
- I said zip it. - I said be quiet.

499
00:31:46,608 --> 00:31:48,668
- Here, here. - What is it?

500
00:31:48,738 --> 00:31:49,768
Now, look here.

501
00:31:50,908 --> 00:31:54,308
Put this on, and from here to there,

502
00:31:54,378 --> 00:31:56,478
walk around the corner three times, okay?

503
00:31:56,918 --> 00:31:59,218
No, what is it? What are you going to do?

504
00:31:59,318 --> 00:32:02,118
Well, the woman at the rice cake shop said so.

505
00:32:02,188 --> 00:32:04,658
She said when your memory is fuzzy,

506
00:32:04,718 --> 00:32:07,058
if you put this rice cooker lid on your head...

507
00:32:07,128 --> 00:32:09,728
and walk around the corner of the room three times,

508
00:32:10,758 --> 00:32:15,128
just like this lid tightly packs the rice together,

509
00:32:15,268 --> 00:32:17,098
your scattered mind...

510
00:32:17,168 --> 00:32:20,808
- will come right back together. - Oh, come on.

511
00:32:20,868 --> 00:32:22,108
Do not believe in things like that.

512
00:32:22,168 --> 00:32:24,138
It is a superstition, a superstition.

513
00:32:24,608 --> 00:32:26,478
I do not like the lid. I am scared of the lid.

514
00:32:27,048 --> 00:32:30,578
You are scared of the lid? Then,

515
00:32:30,648 --> 00:32:34,448
mix dog poop with soybean paste and rub it under your nose. What?

516
00:32:34,818 --> 00:32:37,058
Your wandering mind...

517
00:32:37,118 --> 00:32:39,318
will be so shocked by the smell of the dog poop...

518
00:32:39,388 --> 00:32:41,428
that it will return to its owner.

519
00:32:41,958 --> 00:32:46,558
Should I ask Bori next door to lend us some of his poop?

520
00:32:46,728 --> 00:32:47,728
What should we do?

521
00:32:47,968 --> 00:32:50,568
If you do not want the dog poop either,

522
00:32:50,638 --> 00:32:52,298
