With this,

549
00:34:18,618 --> 00:34:20,888
we are strangers to Gyu Young. No.

550
00:34:21,658 --> 00:34:25,358
We'll be completely unaware of each other's existence.

551
00:34:26,058 --> 00:34:29,298
The Chairman's faults, Gyu Young's faults, our faults,

552
00:34:29,368 --> 00:34:31,768
