557
00:34:44,418 --> 00:34:46,678
- I apologize. - Has this man lost his mind?

558
00:34:46,888 --> 00:34:48,188
Why would you give that back?

559
00:34:54,558 --> 00:34:56,258
To think you'd hand over five million dollars...

560
00:34:56,328 --> 00:34:57,328
