593
00:36:42,468 --> 00:36:43,568
- Okay. - Please stop by.

594
00:36:43,638 --> 00:36:45,438
Thank you. We just opened a clothing store right...

595
00:36:48,408 --> 00:36:49,708
Just take a look around.

596
00:36:50,938 --> 00:36:54,348
(Grand Open All For You)

597
00:36:55,008 --> 00:36:57,448
Hello. Nice to meet you.

598
00:36:57,618 --> 00:37:00,518
