601
00:37:04,788 --> 00:37:06,358
- Okay. - Oh, right.

602
00:37:06,688 --> 00:37:07,958
Come in, please.

603
00:37:09,888 --> 00:37:10,898
Hello. Welcome.

604
00:37:10,958 --> 00:37:12,458
Are you looking for anything in particular?

605
00:37:13,258 --> 00:37:14,268
Inside...

606
00:37:15,128 --> 00:37:17,338
- Welcome. Thank you. - Welcome. Thank you.

607
00:37:17,398 --> 00:37:19,338
- Please feel free to look around. - Please feel free to look around.

608
00:37:21,168 --> 00:37:22,868
- Welcome. - Welcome.

609
00:37:23,538 --> 00:37:24,708
Please feel free to look around.

610
00:37:28,478 --> 00:37:29,478
Gyu Oh.

611
00:37:34,288 --> 00:37:35,718
Congratulations, Gyu Oh.

612
00:37:37,088 --> 00:37:38,418
Thank you, Gyu Rim.

613
00:37:42,588 --> 00:37:44,858
I cannot believe my Gyu Oh is a business owner.

614
00:37:45,998 --> 00:37:48,328
I can die happy now.

615
00:37:55,908 --> 00:37:56,908
You are...

616
00:37:56,978 --> 00:37:58,408
