620
00:38:10,358 --> 00:38:12,458
No, maybe even faster than that,

621
00:38:12,518 --> 00:38:14,888
I could become the owner of that sushi restaurant. Yes.

622
00:38:15,328 --> 00:38:17,958
Wow, then how many business owners do we have in our family?

623
00:38:19,258 --> 00:38:21,468
I thought you said she was not the one.

624
00:38:23,268 --> 00:38:25,498
You can never be sure...

625
00:38:25,568 --> 00:38:27,368
