631
00:38:43,588 --> 00:38:44,918
The four of us with Mu Jin...

632
00:38:45,758 --> 00:38:48,058
Should we try to have a natural gathering?

633
00:38:55,628 --> 00:38:56,628
Gyu Rim.

634
00:39:02,208 --> 00:39:03,208
Gyu Rim.

635
00:39:06,338 --> 00:39:07,578
We need to talk for a second.

636
00:39:10,648 --> 00:39:12,018
- Su Chan. - Yes.

637
00:39:12,078 --> 00:39:13,178
Please take care of the customers.

638
00:39:13,248 --> 00:39:15,148
- Yes, understood. - I am sorry.

639
00:39:15,218 --> 00:39:16,488
I am sorry. Let's go.

640
00:39:17,088 --> 00:39:18,088
The size...

641
