Why, what is wrong?

642
00:39:30,798 --> 00:39:32,168
Brace yourself and look at this.

643
00:39:42,348 --> 00:39:44,848
Allegations have been raised that a famous restaurant...

644
00:39:44,918 --> 00:39:47,218
