649
00:39:56,058 --> 00:39:57,098
Does Mu Jin know?

650
00:39:57,428 --> 00:39:59,558
He probably does, the internet is going crazy right now.

651
00:39:59,628 --> 00:40:01,228
We will launch a full investigation,

652
00:40:01,298 --> 00:40:02,568
and if any illegal activities are confirmed,

653
00:40:02,628 --> 00:40:04,168
