713
00:43:24,138 --> 00:43:25,698
Then honestly, is it not just give and take?

714
00:43:26,468 --> 00:43:27,838
Chef Kim gave me money,

715
00:43:28,108 --> 00:43:30,778
- and I gave him catharsis. - Kim Mu Jin,

716
00:43:30,838 --> 00:43:33,778
