717
00:43:33,838 --> 00:43:35,878
Settlement money? I will pay for it.

718
00:43:37,978 --> 00:43:38,978
Yes.

719
00:43:39,818 --> 00:43:40,818
Hit me if you want to.

720
00:43:50,188 --> 00:43:53,698
There must be a reason why you turned into such a lunatic.

721
00:43:54,828 --> 00:43:56,198
I believe that nothing in this world...

722
00:43:56,868 --> 00:43:58,598
