766
00:46:49,908 --> 00:46:50,908
No...

767
00:46:51,538 --> 00:46:53,408
Why would you ruin your son?

768
00:46:53,478 --> 00:46:56,278
Why would you make him a beggar?

769
00:46:59,078 --> 00:47:01,618
